,{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{},{}],"verses":["2:41","2:42","2:43","2:44","2:45","2:46","2:47","2:48","2:49","2:50","2:51","2:52"],"en":{"2:41":"Every year His parents went to Jerusalem for the Feast of the Passover.","2:42":"And when He was twelve years old, they went up according to the custom of the Feast.","2:43":"When those days were over and they were returning home, the boy Jesus remained behind in Jerusalem, but His parents were unaware He had stayed.","2:44":"Assuming He was in their company, they traveled on for a day before they began to look for Him among their relatives and friends.","2:45":"When they could not find Him, they returned to Jerusalem to search for Him.","2:46":"Finally, after three days they found Him in the temple courts, sitting among the teachers, listening to them and asking them questions.","2:47":"And all who heard Him were astounded at His understanding and His answers.","2:48":"When His parents saw Him, they were astonished. “Child, why have You done this to us?” His mother asked. “Your father and I have been anxiously searching for You.”","2:49":"“Why were you looking for Me?” He asked. “Did you not know that I had to be in My Father’s house?”","2:50":"But they did not understand the statement He was making to them.","2:51":"Then He went down to Nazareth with them and was obedient to them. But His mother treasured up all these things in her heart.","2:52":"And Jesus grew in wisdom and stature, and in favor with God and man."}}},"pairs":{},"minor":[]}